SECTION 1 (HRS 134-9): (1) Sufficiently establishes the urgency or need to carry a firearm unconcealed;
SECTION 1 (HRS 134-9): (2) Is engaged in the protection of life and property;
SECTION 1 (HRS 134-9): (4) Is not prohibited under section 134-7 from the ownership, possession, or control of a firearm and ammunition;
SECTION 1 (HRS 134-9): (6) Is a citizen, national, or lawful permanent resident of the United States; and
SECTION 1 (HRS 134-9): (7) Is of the age of twenty-one years or more.
